1.3.0 — 2026-08-15
  New extended sensor cards: AQI, ozone, nitrogen dioxide, sulfur dioxide,
  carbon monoxide, tree pollen, grass pollen, and sound level, each with a
  color-coded threat badge. The PM1.0/PM2.5/PM10.0 card is unchanged and
  still shown alongside them.
  Threat bands follow US EPA AQI breakpoints (converted to the units WeeWX
  stores) and National Allergy Bureau pollen categories.
  o3, no2, so2, co, and noise are standard WeeWX fields; aqi, pollen_tree,
  and pollen_grass are not, and need columns added before they appear.
  The UV badge now shows just the category, matching every other card.

1.2.1 — 2026-08-15
  Clean directory URLs: the dashboard is served at /, and the other pages
  moved to /history/, /archive/, and /about/ instead of history.html,
  archive.html, and about.html.
  NOTE: the old .html URLs are gone, so update any bookmarks or inbound
  links. Per-year and per-month archive pages keep their .html names.
  Canonical URL drops index.html and tolerates a trailing slash in
  station_url.
  Templates now build every asset and cross-page link from $rel, so page
  depth is defined in one place.

1.2.0 — 2026-08-14
  Current conditions refresh in place from current.json once a minute.
  New [Extras] option: live_update_seconds (0 disables polling).
  JSON exports use UTF-8 instead of HTML entities, so degree signs
  no longer appear as &#176; in the shell or in current.json.

1.1.2 — 2026-08-14
  Cache-bust static CSS as well as JS so upgraded styles take effect.
  Shell input autofocuses and accepts typing without a click.
  Block cursor replaces the native caret and tracks the insertion point.

1.1.1 — 2026-08-14
  Fix recursion crash when an upgraded page loaded a cached matrix.js.
  Safe Mode rain now restarts when switching back to Matrix mode.

1.1.0 — 2026-08-14
  Safe Mode theme toggle: static, high-contrast UI honoring system dark mode.
  Light-palette plot set for Safe Mode on light-color-scheme systems.
  Interactive weather shell in the title bar with pipes, virtual filesystem,
  and easter eggs (including rm -rf /).
  shell-data.json export for shell history commands.
  New [Extras] options: enable_shell, default_theme, shell_history_days.
  Static assets now copy_always so upgrades pick up CSS/JS changes.

1.0.0 — 2026-08-14
  Initial release.
  - Live dashboard with phosphor-green terminal styling and digital rain.
  - History browser with Day/Week/Month/Year plots and statistics table.
  - Deep archive with per-month and per-year generated pages.
  - Extended sensor support (UV, radiation, air quality, lightning) with
    graceful degradation when data is absent.
  - Self-hosted Share Tech Mono and VT323 fonts (SIL Open Font License).
